# WS-AUTH-1 arm results: 16.5 MB each, ~1.39M lines each, essentially all per-group series.
# Untracked 2026-09-19 at the reviewer's request. History is NOT rewritten, so each remains
# permanently retrievable as 9172036:results/whole_system_authority_gNNN.json, which is how the
# WS-AUTH-1 lineage record now references them. From WS-AUTH-2 onward the series lives in the
# gitignored .npz and result JSONs are about 30 KB.
results/whole_system_authority_g050.json
results/whole_system_authority_g100.json
results/whole_system_authority_g200.json
results/whole_system_authority_g500.json

